# Configuration moved (Phase 8)

Per-process env files live next to each binary:

- `gateway/.env.example`
- `services/admin/.env.example`
- `services/merchant/.env.example`
- `services/customer/.env.example`
- `services/ledger/.env.example`
- `services/report/.env.example`

Copy each example to `.env` in the same directory. Services no longer load this repository-root file.

Keep `JWT_SECRET` identical across all services that issue or validate JWTs.
Keep `DB_NAME=paylater` for every business service until the database-split phase.
